            "location": "context",
            "explanation": "This statement is in the error cleanup path after reuseport_attach_prog() fails. The vulnerability stems from improper reference counting - if reuseport_attach_prog() already acquired a reference to the BPF program before failing, calling bpf_prog_put(prog) here could result in double-free or use-after-free. The error handler doesn't verify whether the reference was already transferred to the reuseport structure, leading to incorrect reference count management during program lifecycle."
